        "endIndex": 5064,
        "text": "Chinese experts and tech executives view existential risk narratives coming from US AI leaders either as a Western cultural construct or as a protectionist ploy intended to slow down Chinese competitors and justify US trade controls"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
