        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 5426,
        "endIndex": 5785,
        "text": "### Candidate [3]: Meta Temporarily Disables President Lula’s Facebook Page and Ad Account Before Election\n* **What is confirmed:** Meta temporarily disabled the official Facebook page and campaign ad account of Brazilian President Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva on September 23–24, 2026, roughly 10–11 days ahead of Brazil's October 4 presidential election"
      },
