        "text": "### Candidate [4]: WSJ Examines Effective Altruism's Influence on Anthropic and Employee Relocation Plans\n* **What is confirmed:** A *Wall Street Journal* report detailed how Effective Altruism (EA) philosophy shaped Anthropic’s founding and safety culture"
      },
